        "quote": "(c) Interference with Right-of-Way. A permittee shall not obstruct right-of-way so that the natural free and clear passage of water through the gutters or other waterways is interfered with. Private vehicles may not be parked within or next to a permit area. The loading or unloading of trucks next to permit area is prohibited unless specifically authorized by the permit. (Ord. 17587 § 6-4, 10-24-00. Code 1995 § 130-729.)",
